# The arm64 instructions llrm selects, one form per line: LLVM's AArch64InstrInfo.td
# for this target. Read by `llrm_target::instr` with `dialect.toml`; same columns as x86.instr
# without the assembler column. `h` is a shift (kind, amount), `e` an extend (kind,
# amount), `c` a condition. `{cc}` makes one form per condition.
#
# name  operation  shape  widths  cost  fixed  reads  writes  flags
